    "detailed_description": "It was just supposed to be a job. To help build the next off-world space colony by remotely operating a robotic construction unit, establishing a direct neural link with the machine to control it as if it were your own body. Perfectly safe, they said. Until something went wrong.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNow, trapped in an artificial body and stranded light-years from Earth your only hope is to re-establish contact with the outside world so that you can attempt to re-claim your human body and make it back home.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA 2D platform-adventure game in a large, interconnected world where you'll use action, exploration and puzzle-solving to acquire new abilities and make your way though a space colony full of robots run amok.",
    "about_the_game": "It was just supposed to be a job. To help build the next off-world space colony by remotely operating a robotic construction unit, establishing a direct neural link with the machine to control it as if it were your own body. Perfectly safe, they said. Until something went wrong.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNow, trapped in an artificial body and stranded light-years from Earth your only hope is to re-establish contact with the outside world so that you can attempt to re-claim your human body and make it back home.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA 2D platform-adventure game in a large, interconnected world where you'll use action, exploration and puzzle-solving to acquire new abilities and make your way though a space colony full of robots run amok.",
    "short_description": "A platform adventure game incorporating elements from immersive sims and cinematic platformers. Run, fight and hack your way through a distant space colony as you attempt to reclaim your humanity.",
